{"id":"vod_lz_18710","vodId":"18710","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"盾之勇者成名录","name_cn":"盾之勇者成名录","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220523-1/b5254d5fa8a21a7e4bdef4dcd333e5f4.jpg"},"summary":"岩谷尚文（石川界人 配音）是一个内心里充满了正义感的青年，对世界上发生的很多不公平的事情都深感愤怒。一次偶然中，他被传送到了异世界里，成为了能够使用各种各样不同功能的盾牌的盾之勇者。本以为可以就此展开伸张正义的旅途，哪知道刚刚过去几天，他就经历了战友的背叛，而且丢掉了所有的财物。尚文发誓再也不要信任这个世界里的任何人了。                                                                     　　就在这个节骨眼上，尚文的面前出现了一位名为拉芙塔利亚（濑户麻沙美 配音）的少女，拉芙塔利亚是一名奴隶，尚文决定用金钱来换取忠诚将她买下，在相处的过程中，拉芙塔利亚渐渐爱上了自己的主人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-05-23 14:12:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19316_0457edc6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19318_38e5b876/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19317_38556412/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19319_0817247a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19320_d3bb078c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19322_2e2a2269/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19323_54d7115a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19321_0059910b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19325_ddac6104/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19324_18ffbfd3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19326_cb6c494e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19327_a15587a2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220522/19330_84173bd8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/202205